METHOD NOTE — mutation without writing the shared tree
Mutations were applied with Go's build overlay (`go test -overlay=<json>`),
which substitutes file contents in the BUILD ONLY; nothing was ever written
to disk. In a tree with three concurrent runs (HC, SY1, SY2-in-flight) this
removes any window in which a mutated upsert.go could be compiled or copied
by another agent. Verified regardless with sha256sum bracketing:
  BEFORE: 8a860257cb65acf5f228c405e2bd81cb1c50f45f835b79471c0b38284cb30dbc  internal/services/mcpsvc/curate/upsert.go
